    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics remains a core part of my daily work in computer science, though I don’t engage deeply in advanced theories outside my expertise. It’s practical: problem-solving for coding and data analysis. My father, who studied physics, instilled curiosity, but my vocational diploma focused on applied skills rather than abstract exploration.",
